<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Order Status Update – Ocare Pharmacy</title>
</head>

<body
    style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f6f9; color:#333; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;">
    <div
        style="max-width:600px; margin:40px auto; background-color:#ffffff; padding:30px; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="text-align:center; padding-bottom:20px; border-bottom:2px solid #e6e9ef;">
            <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:26px; font-weight:700; color:#1ca24e;">
                Ocare Pharmacy
            </h1>
            <p style="margin:4px 0 0; color:#777; font-size:14px;">Order Status Update</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#333; padding-top:20px;">
            <p>Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>We wanted to let you know that the status of your order <strong>#{{orderNumber}}</strong> has been
                updated.</p>

            <!-- Status Card -->
            <div
                style="background:#f4f6f9; border-left:4px solid #1ca24e; padding:12px 16px; margin:16px 0; border-radius:4px;">
                <p style="margin:0; font-weight:600;">New Status:</p>
                <p style="margin:4px 0 0; font-size:18px; color:#1ca24e; font-weight:bold;">
                    {{newStatus}}
                </p>
                <p style="margin:8px 0 0; font-size:14px; color:#777;">
                    Updated on: {{statusUpdateDate}}
                </p>
            </div>

            <p>Here’s what this status means for you:</p>
            <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#555;">
                {{statusDescription}}
            </ul>

            <p>You can track your order anytime by visiting your account dashboard:</p>
            <div style="margin:16px 0; text-align:center;">
                <a href="{{trackingLink}}"
                    style="display:inline-block; background:#1ca24e; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;">
                    Track My Order
                </a>
            </div>

            <p>If you have any questions regarding your order, please reach out to our support team at
                <a href="mailto:support@ocareug.com"
                    style="color:#1ca24e; text-decoration:none;">support@ocareug.com</a>.
            </p>

            <p>Thank you for choosing Ocare Pharmacy – we’re committed to delivering your health essentials with care.
            </p>

            <p>Warm regards,<br /><strong>The Ocare Pharmacy Team</strong></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div
            style="margin-top:40px; font-size:12px; color:#777; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e6e9ef; padding-top:20px;">
            &copy; {{year}} Ocare Pharmacy · All rights reserved<br />
            <a href="https://ocareug.com" style="color:#1ca24e; text-decoration:none;">www.ocareug.com</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>